description: Logging and error observability defaults
globs: "**/logger/**,**/Logger.*,**/logging/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Observability

- Structured logs where practical (level, message, request id)
- Never log passwords, tokens, or full payment proof binaries
- Surface user-safe error messages; keep stack details server-side
- Correlate client error reports with server request ids when both exist
